00:35:50.239 --> 00:35:56.239
I'll wait for you again.

00:35:56.239 --> 00:36:00.239
Say goodbye.

00:36:00.239 --> 00:36:02.239
planets don't go that far.

00:36:02.239 --> 00:36:03.239
Yeah.

00:36:03.239 --> 00:36:04.239
Yes.

00:36:04.239 --> 00:36:05.239
Yes.

00:36:05.239 --> 00:36:08.939
I really am sorry.

00:36:10.659 --> 00:36:11.839
You know that, right?

00:36:14.779 --> 00:36:15.559
Yeah, I know.

00:36:35.239 --> 00:36:48.979
Oh, warm fire on a cold night.

00:36:49.959 --> 00:36:51.359
There's nothing like it, is there?

00:36:52.699 --> 00:36:54.079
Thanks for coming by, Dad.

00:36:54.979 --> 00:36:57.199
I know how busy you are with saving the world.

00:36:58.899 --> 00:37:02.559
I was hoping that your call was an olive branch

00:37:02.559 --> 00:37:03.979
that we could reconcile,

00:37:04.979 --> 00:37:05.219
but obviously...

00:37:05.219 --> 00:37:06.279
Obviously, I was wrong.

00:37:08.000 --> 00:37:08.980
Where are you going, Dad?

00:37:10.139 --> 00:37:12.039
Back to the motel out by the interstate?

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:16.599
Or, hey, it's almost dinner time.

00:37:17.139 --> 00:37:18.659
You might still be able to make it to the mission

00:37:18.659 --> 00:37:19.799
for your evening bowl of soup.

00:37:20.480 --> 00:37:23.500
They also serve a surprisingly tasty Salisbury steak.

00:37:29.859 --> 00:37:31.579
You know, I gotta hand it to you, Dad.

00:37:31.659 --> 00:37:33.699
When you throw yourself into a role,

00:37:34.079 --> 00:37:35.199
you really commit.

00:37:35.219 --> 00:37:37.399
This is not an act, Lex.

00:37:38.099 --> 00:37:39.359
You should know that by now.

00:37:39.419 --> 00:37:42.259
You've been having me followed since I was released.

00:37:42.539 --> 00:37:43.579
Which you knew I would.

00:37:46.459 --> 00:37:49.299
I'm not playing at some elaborate game, Lex.

00:37:49.339 --> 00:37:50.599
This is my life now.

00:37:51.739 --> 00:37:53.859
You've stripped me of every penny I once had,

00:37:53.899 --> 00:37:55.139
and I'm making the best of it.

00:37:57.439 --> 00:37:58.219
And you're right.

00:37:58.339 --> 00:37:59.219
It's, uh...

00:37:59.899 --> 00:38:02.679
It's about time for my evening bowl of soup.

00:38:05.219 --> 00:38:07.219
Dad...

00:38:08.039 --> 00:38:11.279
You can stay in the guest house.

00:38:13.939 --> 00:38:14.339
Thanks.

00:38:17.239 --> 00:38:19.099
It'll be much easier keeping an eye on me.

00:38:21.480 --> 00:38:22.339
Good night, Dad.

00:38:22.339 --> 00:38:22.399
Good night.

00:38:35.219 --> 00:38:35.899
Good night.

00:38:36.019 --> 00:38:37.899
Good night.

00:38:40.119 --> 00:38:40.859
Good night.

00:38:40.859 --> 00:38:41.659
Good night.

00:38:41.659 --> 00:38:42.519
Is Dad still upset?

00:38:42.519 --> 00:38:42.719
Good night.

00:38:42.719 --> 00:38:43.719
Good night.

00:38:44.679 --> 00:38:45.699
What do you think?

00:38:48.699 --> 00:38:49.519
How about you?

00:38:53.879 --> 00:38:55.119
I'm upset.

00:38:57.179 --> 00:38:59.099
But more than that, I'm disappointed.

00:39:02.480 --> 00:39:04.339
I was on red kryptonite, Mom.

00:39:05.219 --> 00:39:10.219
My God, you ran off with a girl you barely know and got married.

00:39:10.219 --> 00:39:11.219
It wasn't legal.

00:39:11.219 --> 00:39:13.219
That's not even the point.

00:39:13.219 --> 00:39:15.219
Marriage is sacred, Clark.

00:39:15.219 --> 00:39:17.219
It's about two people who trust each other

00:39:17.219 --> 00:39:20.219
and are willing to go through life together no matter how difficult it gets.

00:39:20.219 --> 00:39:23.219
I thought we had taught you that.

00:39:27.219 --> 00:39:29.219
You're an amazing young man, Clark.

00:39:29.219 --> 00:39:32.219
You make life and death decisions every day.

00:39:32.219 --> 00:39:36.219
But then you turn around and you do this.

00:39:36.219 --> 00:39:38.219
Why did you do it?

00:39:38.219 --> 00:39:45.219
Mom, there's a part of me that never feels freer than when I'm with Alicia.

00:39:48.219 --> 00:39:52.219
She makes me feel normal and special at the same time.

00:39:53.219 --> 00:39:56.219
I know how badly you want to be with somebody.

00:39:56.219 --> 00:39:58.219
I want that for you, too.

00:40:00.219 --> 00:40:02.219
I guess...

00:40:02.219 --> 00:40:06.219
I just expected you to use better judgment.

00:40:24.219 --> 00:40:26.219
Guess I know why you're alone.

00:40:27.219 --> 00:40:30.219
Hey, Alicia.

00:40:33.219 --> 00:40:34.219
What's going on?

00:40:34.219 --> 00:40:37.219
What did you say?

00:40:40.219 --> 00:40:42.219
Do you notice me so released?

00:40:44.219 --> 00:40:46.219
Anyways, you'll be home by me cool as new.

00:40:50.219 --> 00:40:51.219
It's you, Jack?

00:40:51.219 --> 00:40:53.219
scarcity.

00:40:58.219 --> 00:40:59.219
I'm the one who shops?

00:40:59.219 --> 00:41:00.219
Yeah.

00:41:00.219 --> 00:41:05.359
I have faith in you.

00:41:11.359 --> 00:41:14.819
Look, I know that we can never be together after what I did.

00:41:19.539 --> 00:41:21.259
But it doesn't change how I feel.

00:41:23.599 --> 00:41:25.339
And I just wanted you to know that

00:41:25.339 --> 00:41:29.459
for as long as I live, I'm never going to reveal your secret.

00:41:30.219 --> 00:41:40.339
I love you.

00:41:41.179 --> 00:41:41.579
That's all.

00:41:48.899 --> 00:41:49.839
Alicia, wait.

00:41:51.839 --> 00:41:52.519
Wait.

00:42:00.219 --> 00:42:30.199
I love you.

00:42:30.219 --> 00:43:00.199
I love you.

00:43:00.219 --> 00:43:00.980
I love you.

